{"step_index":1410,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:46:01Z","input_tokens":4105,"cache_read_tokens":85756,"output_tokens":4948,"thinking":"The `evolutionEngine.ts` file needs a function to determine a level tier based on experience points. Defining the `LevelTier` interface is the first step, outlining level, title, XP range, and associated perk. Now, constructing the base level tiers, starting with level one and its associated attributes.\n\n\nDefining an array of base level tiers with associated XP ranges and perks. The function `computeLevelTier` needs to iterate through these tiers to determine the appropriate level. If XP exceeds all base tiers, procedural tiers with increasing XP spans are generated. The title logic is updated to reflect an escalating title based on level.\n\n\nThe level tier generation now includes a procedural system for levels beyond the predefined base tiers, using an exponentially increasing experience span.  Level titles dynamically escalate, reflecting the increasing challenge, with distinct title structures for levels 50-99 and 100+. The associated perk for each level is computed based on a capped linear function, increasing the calibration and edge. The `currentLevelMinXp` field within `EvolutionState` is now defined by the minimum XP for the current level.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Implement infinite procedural level formula in evolutionEngine.ts","EndLine":115,"Instruction":"Replace LEVEL_TIERS and addExperience with computeLevelTier infinite procedural scaling","ReplacementContent":"import { EvolutionState, AdaptiveWeights, EvolutionEvent } from '../types';\n\nexport interface LevelTier {\n  level: number;\n  title: string;\n  minXp: number;\n  maxXp: number;\n  perk: string;\n}\n\nexport const BASE_LEVEL_TIERS: LevelTier[] = [\n  { level: 1, title: 'Novice Algorithmic Desk', minXp: 0, maxXp: 150, perk: 'Basic regime detection' },\n  { level: 2, title: 'Pattern Recognition Engine', minXp: 150, maxXp: 350, perk: '+5% False Breakout Veto' },\n  { level: 3, title: 'Microstructure Analyst', minXp: 350, maxXp: 650, perk: '+8% Order Book Calibration' },\n  { level: 4, title: 'Adaptive Regime Specialist', minXp: 650, maxXp: 1100, perk: '+12% Dynamic Kelly Precision' },\n  { level: 5, title: 'Asymmetric Risk Architect', minXp: 1100, maxXp: 1750, perk: '+15% Drawdown Shielding' },\n  { level: 6, title: 'High-Convexity Quant', minXp: 1750, maxXp: 2600, perk: '+18% Regime Matching Accuracy' },\n  { level: 7, title: 'Bayesian Inference Engine', minXp: 2600, maxXp: 3700, perk: '+22% Noise Filtering' },\n  { level: 8, title: 'Alpha Protocol Desk', minXp: 3700, maxXp: 5200, perk: '+26% Asymmetric Payoff Targeting' },\n  { level: 9, title: 'Autonomous Capital Master', minXp: 5200, maxXp: 7200, perk: '+30% Multi-Timeframe Synthesis' },\n];\n\nexport function computeLevelTier(xp: number): LevelTier {\n  for (const tier of BASE_LEVEL_TIERS) {\n    if (xp < tier.maxXp) {\n      return tier;\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Infinite procedural tiers starting at Level 10\n  let lvl = 10;\n  let minXp = 7200;\n  let span = 2600;\n\n  while (true) {\n    const maxXp = minXp + span;\n    if (xp < maxXp) {\n      let title = `Quantitative Grandmaster · Paragon ${lvl - 9}`;\n      if (lvl >= 20 && lvl < 30) {\n        title = `Sovereign Alpha Overlord · Stage ${lvl - 19}`;\n      } else if (lvl >= 30 && lvl < 50) {\n        title = `Singularity Market Deity · Epoch ${lvl - 29}`;\n      } else if (lvl >= 50 && lvl < 100) {\n        title = `Hyper-Dimensional Quant Nexus · Phase ${lvl - 49}`;\n      } else if (lvl >= 100) {\n        title = `Eternal Autonomous Omnipresence · Tier ${lvl}`;\n      }\n\n      const perk = `+${Math.min(99, 30 + (lvl - 9) * 2)}% Confluence Calibration & Asymmetric Edge`;\n\n      return {\n        level: lvl,\n        title,\n        minXp,\n        maxXp,\n        perk\n      };\n    }\n\n    minXp = maxXp;\n    span = Math.round(span * 1.25);\n    lvl++;\n  }\n}\n\nexport const INITIAL_EVOLUTION: EvolutionState = {\n  level: 1,\n  title: 'Novice Algorithmic Desk',\n  xp: 0,\n  nextLevelXp: 150,\n  currentLevelMinXp: 0,\n  winStreak: 0,\n  totalTrades: 0,\n  totalWins: 0,\n  adaptiveWeights: {\n    regimePrecision: 5.0,\n    falseBreakoutFilter: 6.0,\n    sentimentCalibration: 4.0,\n    dynamicSizingEdge: 5.0\n  },\n  recentEvolutions: [\n    {\n      id: 'init_evo',\n      timestamp: new Date().toTimeString().split(' ')[0],\n      text: 'Neural Evolution Core Initialized. Learning active.',\n      type: 'XP'\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\nconst STORAGE_KEY = 'grok_hermes_evolution_v2';\n\nexport function loadStoredEvolution(): EvolutionState {\n  try {\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n    if (raw) {\n      const parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n      // Re-evaluate level tier in case XP changed or formula updated\n      const tier = computeLevelTier(parsed.xp || 0);\n      return {\n        ...parsed,\n        level: tier.level,\n        title: tier.title,\n        nextLevelXp: tier.maxXp,\n        currentLevelMinXp: tier.minXp\n      };\n    }\n  } catch {\n    // fallback\n  }\n  return INITIAL_EVOLUTION;\n}\n\nexport function saveStoredEvolution(state: EvolutionState): void {\n  try {\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(state));\n  } catch {\n    // ignore\n  }\n}\n\nexport function addExperience(\n  current: EvolutionState,\n  amount: number,\n  reason: string,\n  type: 'XP' | 'LEVEL_UP' | 'WEIGHT_UPDATE' = 'XP'\n): EvolutionState {\n  const newXp = current.xp + amount;\n  const matchedTier = computeLevelTier(newXp);\n  const isLevelUp = matchedTier.level > current.level;\n  const timeStr = new Date().toTimeString().split(' ')[0];\n\n  const newEvents: EvolutionEvent[] = [\n    {\n      id: `evo_${Date.now()}_${Math.random()}`,\n      timestamp: timeStr,\n      text: isLevelUp ? `⚡ LEVEL UP! Ascended to Level ${matchedTier.level}: ${matchedTier.title}! (${matchedTier.perk})` : `+${amount} XP: ${reason}`,\n      type: isLevelUp ? 'LEVEL_UP' : type\n    },\n    ...current.recentEvolutions.slice(0, 15)\n  ];\n\n  // If leveled up, boost adaptive weights\n  let updatedWeights = { ...current.adaptiveWeights };\n  if (isLevelUp) {\n    const levelDelta = matchedTier.level - current.level;\n    updatedWeights = {\n      regimePrecision: Number((updatedWeights.regimePrecision + 2.5 * levelDelta).toFixed(1)),\n      falseBreakoutFilter: Number((updatedWeights.falseBreakoutFilter + 3.0 * levelDelta).toFixed(1)),\n      sentimentCalibration: Number((updatedWeights.sentimentCalibration + 2.0 * levelDelta).toFixed(1)),\n      dynamicSizingEdge: Number((updatedWeights.dynamicSizingEdge + 2.5 * levelDelta).toFixed(1))\n    };\n  }\n\n  const updated: EvolutionState = {\n    ...current,\n    level: matchedTier.level,\n    title: matchedTier.title,\n    xp: newXp,\n    nextLevelXp: matchedTier.maxXp,\n    currentLevelMinXp: matchedTier.minXp,\n    adaptiveWeights: updatedWeights,\n    recentEvolutions: newEvents\n  };\n\n  saveStoredEvolution(updated);\n  return updated;\n}","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"import { EvolutionState, AdaptiveWeights, EvolutionEvent } from '../types';\n\nexport const LEVEL_TIERS: { level: number; title: string; minXp: number; maxXp: number; perk: string }[] = [\n  { level: 1, title: 'Novice Algorithmic Desk', minXp: 0, maxXp: 150, perk: 'Basic regime detection' },\n  { level: 2, title: 'Pattern Recognition Engine', minXp: 150, maxXp: 350, perk: '+5% False Breakout Veto' },\n  { level: 3, title: 'Microstructure Analyst', minXp: 350, maxXp: 650, perk: '+8% Order Book Calibration' },\n  { level: 4, title: 'Adaptive Regime Specialist', minXp: 650, maxXp: 1100, perk: '+12% Dynamic Kelly Precision' },\n  { level: 5, title: 'Asymmetric Risk Architect', minXp: 1100, maxXp: 1750, perk: '+15% Drawdown Shielding' },\n  { level: 6, title: 'High-Convexity Quant', minXp: 1750, maxXp: 2600, perk: '+18% Regime Matching Accuracy' },\n  { level: 7, title: 'Bayesian Inference Engine', minXp: 2600, maxXp: 3700, perk: '+22% Noise Filtering' },\n  { level: 8, title: 'Alpha Protocol Desk', minXp: 3700, maxXp: 5200, perk: '+26% Asymmetric Payoff Targeting' },\n  { level: 9, title: 'Autonomous Capital Master', minXp: 5200, maxXp: 7200, perk: '+30% Multi-Timeframe Synthesis' },\n  { level: 10, title: 'Quantitative Grandmaster', minXp: 7200, maxXp: 99999, perk: 'Maximum Wisdom & Sovereign Execution' }\n];\n\nexport const INITIAL_EVOLUTION: EvolutionState = {\n  level: 1,\n  title: 'Novice Algorithmic Desk',\n  xp: 0,\n  nextLevelXp: 150,\n  winStreak: 0,\n  totalTrades: 0,\n  totalWins: 0,\n  adaptiveWeights: {\n    regimePrecision: 5.0,\n    falseBreakoutFilter: 6.0,\n    sentimentCalibration: 4.0,\n    dynamicSizingEdge: 5.0\n  },\n  recentEvolutions: [\n    {\n      id: 'init_evo',\n      timestamp: new Date().toTimeString().split(' ')[0],\n      text: 'Neural Evolution Core Initialized. Learning active.',\n      type: 'XP'\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\nconst STORAGE_KEY = 'grok_hermes_evolution_v2';\n\nexport function loadStoredEvolution(): EvolutionState {\n  try {\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n    if (raw) {\n      return JSON.parse(raw);\n    }\n  } catch {\n    // fallback\n  }\n  return INITIAL_EVOLUTION;\n}\n\nexport function saveStoredEvolution(state: EvolutionState): void {\n  try {\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(state));\n  } catch {\n    // ignore\n  }\n}\n\nexport function addExperience(\n  current: EvolutionState,\n  amount: number,\n  reason: string,\n  type: 'XP' | 'LEVEL_UP' | 'WEIGHT_UPDATE' = 'XP'\n): EvolutionState {\n  const newXp = current.xp + amount;\n  \n  // Find matching level\n  let matchedTier = LEVEL_TIERS[0];\n  for (const tier of LEVEL_TIERS) {\n    if (newXp >= tier.minXp) {\n      matchedTier = tier;\n    }\n  }\n\n  const isLevelUp = matchedTier.level > current.level;\n  const timeStr = new Date().toTimeString().split(' ')[0];\n\n  const newEvents: EvolutionEvent[] = [\n    {\n      id: `evo_${Date.now()}_${Math.random()}`,\n      timestamp: timeStr,\n      text: isLevelUp ? `⚡ LEVEL UP! Ascended to Level ${matchedTier.level}: ${matchedTier.title}! (${matchedTier.perk})` : `+${amount} XP: ${reason}`,\n      type: isLevelUp ? 'LEVEL_UP' : type\n    },\n    ...current.recentEvolutions.slice(0, 15)\n  ];\n\n  // If leveled up, boost adaptive weights\n  let updatedWeights = { ...current.adaptiveWeights };\n  if (isLevelUp) {\n    updatedWeights = {\n      regimePrecision: Number((updatedWeights.regimePrecision + 2.5).toFixed(1)),\n      falseBreakoutFilter: Number((updatedWeights.falseBreakoutFilter + 3.0).toFixed(1)),\n      sentimentCalibration: Number((updatedWeights.sentimentCalibration + 2.0).toFixed(1)),\n      dynamicSizingEdge: Number((updatedWeights.dynamicSizingEdge + 2.5).toFixed(1))\n    };\n  }\n\n  const updated: EvolutionState = {\n    ...current,\n    level: matchedTier.level,\n    title: matchedTier.title,\n    xp: newXp,\n    nextLevelXp: matchedTier.maxXp,\n    adaptiveWeights: updatedWeights,\n    recentEvolutions: newEvents\n  };\n\n  saveStoredEvolution(updated);\n  return updated;\n}","TargetFile":"/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/engine/evolutionEngine.ts","toolAction":"Updating evolutionEngine with infinite tiers","toolSummary":"Update evolutionEngine.ts"}}]}
